#                               The Astronomer Deployment Lifecycle: From Code to Production
The Big Picture of This Document
This document explains how Astronomer (Astro) manages Apache Airflow deployments professionally in enterprise environments.

The main focus is:
  How code moves from developer laptop → testing → production
  How CI/CD automates deployments
  How Docker images work in Astro
  How environment variables and Airflow connections are managed safely
  How enterprises avoid breaking production pipelines

The entire document is about building a safe, scalable, automated deployment lifecycle for Airflow projects.

